OL,3,GNEWSAFans praise Catherine Zeta-Jones
OL,4,Afor using her Welsh accent in new
OL,5,Aseries
OL,6,
OL,7,FCatherine Zeta-Jones has been praised
OL,8,Fby fans as she uses her natural Welsh
OL,9,Faccent in an upcoming thriller series.
OL,11,FThe 56-year-old Hollywood actor
OL,12,Freturned to her hometown of Swansea,
OL,13,Fwhere some of the filming took place
OL,14,Ffor Amazon's Kill Jackie.
OL,16,FA trailer released on social media
OL,17,Fgives viewers their first glimpse of
OL,18,Fthe show, as well as a snippet of
OL,19,FZeta-Jones using her Swansea accent.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
