OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Oscar-winning star plays Jackie
OL,8,FPrice, an extravagant jet-setter who is
OL,9,Ftrying to stay anonymous after escaping
OL,10,Fa "dangerous past as an international
OL,11,Fcocaine dealer," according to Amazon
OL,12,FPrime.
